{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<h3><b><font id=\"nrw4u\" size=\"4\">尊敬的客户，您好！</font></b></h3><div><b><font size=\"4\"><br/></font></b></div><p><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;为进一步提升服务体验，自2021年10月1日起，京东物流对京东快运增值产品【保价服务】标准价格进行调整。整车直达产品收费标准调整为，单票保价费用=该票货物声明价值*保价费率5‰，最低收费为30元/票，低于最低收费时，按最低收费执行；特快重货产品收费标准调整为，单票保价费用=该票货物声明价值*保价费5‰，最低收费为1元，低于最低收费时，按最低收费执行。</font></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;保价服务具体收费标准可通过京东物流官网-服务细则进行查询，也可咨询当地销售人员。由此给您带来的不便敬请谅解，感谢您的理解和支持！</span></p><p><font size=\"3\"><br/></font></p><p><font size=\"3\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</font><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">京东物流</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: DengXian;\"><font style=\"text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nb